##grflangid 0x01
STR_GRF_NAME_TREE						:Zyliety's Tree Set
STR_GRF_DESCRIPTION_TREE				:A graphics replacement set for trees. Covers Temperate, Arctic, and now Tropic climates. Inspired by the lovely scenery of Japan.2026/1/15{}Draw by: Zyliety. {}Code:Ufiby, reldred.{}License:GPLv2 or higher
STR_GRF_URL         :https://github.com/zyliety/Zyliety-Tree-Set

STR_OPENTTD_VERSION						:1.10.0

STR_PARAM_TREES_NAME					:Add shader for trees
STR_PARAM_TREES_DESC					:Toggle the addition of a shader for trees. This shader will make trees look more realistic by adding shadows and highlights.{}This corresponds to the solar elevation angle in the real world around 10:00–11:00 AM (or 2:00–3:00 PM). The sunlight is fairly bright, giving objects a strong sense of volume and depth, but the shadows aren't quite as short as they would be at noon, when they'd be almost directly underfoot.
STR_PARAM_TREES_0                       :No shader
STR_PARAM_TREES_1                       :With shader

STR_PARAM_TEMPERATE_NAME				:Replace Temperate trees
STR_PARAM_TEMPERATE_DESC				:Toggle the replacement of Temperate climate trees.

STR_PARAM_ARCTIC_NAME					:Replace Arctic trees
STR_PARAM_ARCTIC_DESC					:Toggle the replacement of Arctic climate trees.

STR_PARAM_TROPIC_NAME					:Replace Tropic trees
STR_PARAM_TROPIC_DESC					:Toggle the replacement of Tropic climate trees.